WEBVTT

00:00:14.960 --> 00:00:15.933
<v><b>Rob:</b></v> Hey, Alan.

00:00:18.096 --> 00:00:21.144
Would you like to come to the match with me on Sunday?

00:00:21.250 --> 00:00:25.542
It’s Norwich against Chelsea, and I have two tickets.

00:00:26.203 --> 00:00:27.176
<v><b>Alan:</b></v> Wow!

00:00:27.718 --> 00:00:29.398
What time’s the match?

00:00:29.610 --> 00:00:31.876
<v><b>Rob:</b></v> It’s at four o’clock.

00:00:32.643 --> 00:00:34.960
<v><b>Alan:</b></v> Yeah, I’d love to. Thanks.

00:00:35.688 --> 00:00:38.025
<v><b>Rob:</b></v> Would you like to meet for lunch first?

00:00:38.234 --> 00:00:39.856
<v><b>Alan:</b></v> Sorry, I can’t.

00:00:40.267 --> 00:00:41.807
It’s my mum’s birthday,

00:00:41.859 --> 00:00:43.360
and I need to have lunch with her.

00:00:44.006 --> 00:00:45.776
But I can meet you there.

00:00:46.070 --> 00:00:46.521
<v><b>Rob:</b></v> Great.

00:00:46.954 --> 00:00:51.242
Let’s meet at half past three at the entrance to the Tube station.

00:00:51.817 --> 00:00:53.403
<v><b>Alan:</b></v> Fine. See you there.

00:01:17.472 --> 00:01:20.149
<v><b>Alan:</b></v> They are playing really badly.

00:01:20.724 --> 00:01:22.270
I hope the second half is better.

00:01:22.430 --> 00:01:24.989
<v><b>Rob:</b></v> Me, too. I know they can win.

00:01:27.222 --> 00:01:28.820
Would you like a burger?

00:01:29.324 --> 00:01:31.692
<v><b>Alan:</b></v> No, thanks. I’m not very hungry.

00:01:32.278 --> 00:01:34.600
<v><b>Rob:</b></v> How about a coffee?

00:01:34.991 --> 00:01:36.102
<v><b>Alan:</b></v> Yeah, great.

00:01:42.917 --> 00:01:45.959
<v><b>Rob:</b></v> Um, a burger and a water, please.

00:01:45.985 --> 00:01:47.172
<v><b>Alan:</b></v> And I’d like a coffee.

00:01:47.318 --> 00:01:48.184
<v><b>Barman:</b></v> Milk and sugar?

00:01:48.185 --> 00:01:48.971
<v><b>Alan:</b></v> Yes, please.